  "reward_bound_derivation": "At most 16 actors can serve per step, so any actor receives at most 16*0.5 shared, 16*1.5 recipient-kitchen and 2 personal reward: 34. A deliberately loose waste upper count is 16 discards + 16 carried expiries + 28 belt expiries = 60, yielding at worst -3 shared waste, -0.4 wrong service, -0.3 local deadline and -0.04 effort/resource cost. Therefore [-5,40] encloses the native reward. Stage, report, utility and conveyor values are bounded by 64 or less, service clocks by 96 and native t by 384; reward components fit the declared observation bounds [-5,384].",
